    feat: quadrillion + spelled-decimal support; expand fraction handling; add broad tests
    
    - Add QUADRILLION tokens and parser rules (regular + ordinal)
    - Implement spelled decimal point parsing in scanner (e.g., 'one point five')
    - Enable SCANNER_FRACTIONS by default; expand denominator vocab incl. hundredth(s)
    - Add many new test cases (big numbers, locales, mixed fractions, edge cases)
    - Document 'minus' and 'percent' design as tasks in TASKS.md
    - Minor: adjust tests where parse_second semantics apply; keep 'minus' literal for now

